es(maxLength:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every chordless (induced) cycle of the graph once, lazily: a simple cycle whose vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"induce no edge but its own. Each starts at its least vertex in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order and leaves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it through the lesser of its two edges there, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"simpleCycles()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists it; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UndirectedChordlessCycles"},{"type":"text","text":" for the order, loops and parallel edges."}]}}}